A new issue has been opened by @janedoe:

Title: RAG upload fails on large PDFs (#4521)

When uploading PDF files larger than 50MB to a knowledge base,
the upload silently fails. No error is shown in the UI, but the
document never appears in the knowledge base.

Steps to reproduce:
1. Create a knowledge base
2. Upload a PDF larger than 50MB
3. Wait for processing
4. Document is missing from the list

Expected: Large PDFs should either upload successfully or show
a clear error message with the size limit.

--boundary42
